---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Service | Foam War Parties" description="Terms for using the Foam War Parties website and booking DIY rentals or full-service parties." active={null}>
<section style="position:relative;background:#182B49;color:#fff;padding:20px 0 36px;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center"><img src="/images/foam-lineart.png" alt="" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:invert(1);mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.13">
<div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 50% 38%,rgba(14,26,46,.92) 0%,rgba(14,26,46,.6) 55%,rgba(14,26,46,0) 100%)">
</div>
<div style="position:relative;max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx);width:100%;text-align:center">
<h1 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,64px);line-height:1;margin:0;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(10,20,38,.6)">Terms of <span style="color:#FF7518;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,117,24,.28),0 0 12px rgba(255,117,24,.16)">Service</span></h1>
</div>
</section>
<section style="background:#fff;color:#182B49;padding:72px 0">
<div style="max-width:1200px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto;padding:0 var(--padx)">
<div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px">
<div style="display:inline-block;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase">Last updated: November 23, 2026</div>
</div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:24px;align-items:stretch">
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">1</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Agreement to Terms</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">By using this website or booking with Foam War Parties, you agree to these terms.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">2</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Services</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">We offer DIY foam blaster equipment rentals and full-service foam war parties in Southwest Missouri.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">3</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Bookings & Payments</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">DIY rentals require 50% of the rental total at booking. The remaining balance is due before equipment is released at pickup or delivery. Full-service payment terms are confirmed at booking.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">4</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Rental Agreement & Waiver</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">All equipment rentals require a signed rental agreement and liability waiver before equipment is released. Customers must separately initial the equipment responsibility section and the liability waiver before signing.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">5</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Equipment Responsibility</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Renters are responsible for equipment while it is in their possession. Lost, stolen, missing or damaged equipment (beyond normal wear and tear) will be charged at the reasonable current replacement cost.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">6</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Safety</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Customers agree to follow all safety rules, including wearing protective goggles, providing adult supervision for children, and using only approved foam ammunition.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">7</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Cancellations</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Cancellation and weather terms are confirmed when you book. Call or text <a href="tel:+14175592347" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">(417) 559-2347</a> if you need to change or cancel a date.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">8</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Pricing</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">Prices are subject to change. Your price is confirmed at the time of booking.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">9</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Limitation of Liability</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">To the extent permitted by law, Foam War Parties is not liable for injuries or damages arising from the use of rented equipment or participation in activities.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF7518;color:#182B49;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">10</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Governing Law</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty">These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Missouri.</p>
</div>
<div style="background:#F3F4F6;border-radius:28px;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#0875D1;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px">11</div>
<h3 style="font-family:'Archivo Black',sans-serif;font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0;color:#182B49">Contact</h3>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;text-wrap:pretty"><a href="tel:+14175592347" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">(417) 559-2347</a> · <a href="mailto:joshuaenglish72@gmail.com" style="color:#0875D1;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none">joshuaenglish72@gmail.com</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
